<title>USA: First USA buys Checkfree portfolio.</title>
<headline>First USA buys Checkfree portfolio.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>First USA Paymentech Inc on Wednesday said it has acquired the credit card processing portfolio of CheckFree Corp.</p>
<p>Financial terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>The acquisition includes merchant contracts for credit card and automated clearing house processing. CheckFree and Paymentech have also entered into a two-year referral agreement for new business in which CheckFree will refer merchant credit card processing prospects to Paymentech.</p>
<p>In 1996, CheckFree credit card services processed nearly 42 million credit card and automated clearing house transactions for a total of more than $847 million in sales, First USA said.</p>
</text>
